    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/1a844ac3afe851cb54b80a6f5039cf58.poster.avif?t=1752080022\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/1a844ac3afe851cb54b80a6f5039cf58.webm?t=1752080022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/1a844ac3afe851cb54b80a6f5039cf58.mp4?t=1752080022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You play as Howard, a man desperate to escape, but the world around him has twisted into something unrecognizable. His journey takes him through bizarre and disturbing places, crawling with grotesque creatures and strange characters. As he unravels his role in this nightmarish reality, it becomes clear that escaping will be far more difficult than he ever imagined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/4c85b253609ceee0e0fa203b4330ee2d.poster.avif?t=1752080022\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/4c85b253609ceee0e0fa203b4330ee2d.webm?t=1752080022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/4c85b253609ceee0e0fa203b4330ee2d.mp4?t=1752080022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person horror with a gripping mystery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense puzzle-solving and psychological horror elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply atmospheric world filled with disturbing encounters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the horrors head-on\u2014sometimes the only way to survive is to fight back</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/1a844ac3afe851cb54b80a6f5039cf58.poster.avif?t=1752080022\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/1a844ac3afe851cb54b80a6f5039cf58.webm?t=1752080022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/1a844ac3afe851cb54b80a6f5039cf58.mp4?t=1752080022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You play as Howard, a man desperate to escape, but the world around him has twisted into something unrecognizable. His journey takes him through bizarre and disturbing places, crawling with grotesque creatures and strange characters. As he unravels his role in this nightmarish reality, it becomes clear that escaping will be far more difficult than he ever imagined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/4c85b253609ceee0e0fa203b4330ee2d.poster.avif?t=1752080022\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/4c85b253609ceee0e0fa203b4330ee2d.webm?t=1752080022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/4c85b253609ceee0e0fa203b4330ee2d.mp4?t=1752080022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person horror with a gripping mystery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense puzzle-solving and psychological horror elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply atmospheric world filled with disturbing encounters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the horrors head-on\u2014sometimes the only way to survive is to fight back</p></li></ul>",
